## Architecture
```mermaid
flowchart LR

subgraph System-A
  P1[Openfilenet Peer]
  A1[Share Files on TCP]
  A2[TCP File Server]
end

subgraph System-B
  P2[Openfilenet Peer]
  B1[Get files on TCP]
end

P1 -- "1. UDP Broadcast" --> P2
P2 -- "2. UDP Reply" --> P1
P1 -- "3. Announce Reply" --> P2
P2 -- "4. Request Files on TCP" --> A2 --> B1
A1 --> A2 

```

